## Pool cache
fresh cache, bundle and repo: identical files (sha256 1da2a870...).
fresh cache (this PC) vs the cloud cache: 6144 entries, 1486 differ, all of them budget episodes (1847 budget episodes); median relative difference 8.2e-12,
maximum 4.02e-02. Cause: E_task comes from L1 reference-brain rollouts, which differ between the machines (verified_values.md, "## Platform reproduction").
The repository keeps the cloud cache (data/pools/l2_pool_E0_6144.json, identical to the bundle's); runs on this PC that use it reproduce the bundle code
bit-identically. A fresh cache would change the training pool: keep the cloud cache, do not regenerate it.

